GAL22V10
adecode1613	; Address decoder

nWR    IOP     A15     A14     A13    A12	 A11    A10    A9     A8     A7      GND
A6     A5      A4      A3      A2     A1	 nMBINT	nCESHM nCEROM nCERAM A0		 VCC

; Shared RAM : 0x?0000 - 0x?0FFF (?=0, 1, 2)
/nCESHM = /A15 * /A14 * /A13 * /A12 * /IOP

; ROM : 0x?F800 - 0x?FFFF (?=0, 1, 2)
/nCEROM = A15 * A14 * A13 * A12 * A11 * /IOP

; RAM : 0x01000 - 0x0F7ff, 0x11000 - 0x1F7FF, 0x21000 - 0x2F7FF, 0x31000 - 0x3F7FF
/nCERAM = nCESHM * nCEROM * /IOP

; Mail Box command byte: 0x?0042 (?=0, 1, 2)
; The MBINT signal is asserted when a _write_ is made to the command byte (0x42)
; in the "Mail Box" area (0x40-0x4F) and de-asserted when the handshake byte (0x41) 
; is _accessed_ (i.e. read or write).
nMBINT.R = nMBINT
SP = /nCESHM * /A11 * /A10 * /A9 * /A8 * /A7 *  A6 * /A5 * /A4 * /A3 * /A2 *  A1 * /A0
AR = /nCESHM * /A11 * /A10 * /A9 * /A8 * /A7 *  A6 * /A5 * /A4 * /A3 * /A2 * /A1 *  A0

DESCRIPTION

These equations are used for implementing the address decoder for MN1613 CPU Board
